("We teach aviation management, airport operations, cabin crew, cargo, travel and tourism, and ICT. Each programme has its own page with its details, intakes and fees.","Nous enseignons la gestion de l'aviation, les opérations aéroportuaires, le personnel de cabine, le fret, le voyage et le tourisme, et les TIC. Chaque programme a sa page avec ses détails, ses sessions et ses frais.","Twigisha imiyoborere y'ingendo z'indege, imikorere y'ibibuga by'indege, abakozi bo mu ndege, imizigo, ingendo n'ubukerarugendo, na ICT. Buri porogaramu ifite urupapuro rwayo rugaragaza ibisobanuro, ibyiciro n'amafaranga.","Tunafundisha usimamizi wa usafiri wa anga, uendeshaji wa viwanja vya ndege, wahudumu wa ndani ya ndege, mizigo, usafiri na utalii, na TEHAMA. Kila programu ina ukurasa wake wenye maelezo, makundi na ada."),
